{"version":1,"content":"<p>開源編程語言PHP的維護工作正面臨嚴峻的資源壓力。儘管PHP已經發展了約30年，並支撐着全球大量網站的運行，但負責支持這一語言發展的非營利組織PHP基金會，卻長期處於資金不足的狀態。基金會執行董事伊麗莎白·巴倫近日透露，組織目前只有一名全職員工，其餘工作主要依靠兼職承包人員、捐款和資助維持。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583652.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.809362+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:58:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_hash":"901f76a69f45506d1954c81d7291eff254b6fa253e1eb59c4cbcaaa638762260","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}